  <data key="d7">{"finding": "1D_CNN breakthrough pattern: Simple architectures (2-3 conv layers, 16-32 filters) with high dropout (0.6-0.65) and low learning rates (0.0001-0.0002) consistently deliver accelerating performance improvements (56.5% \u2192 66.2% \u2192 73.2% accuracy). Key insights: validation loss strongly correlates with accuracy (-0.86 correlation), learning speed is critical (+0.78 correlation), and longer training (135+ epochs) yields better results. Kernel size 3 performs best overall, but kernel size 5 also shows success.", "experiment_name": "1D_CNN"}</data>
  <data key="d8">[-0.05450000000000001, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0]</data>
</edge>
